// 10-minicalc -- P13: errors, fmt, mem; P03.08: `return nil, err` in `!` functions
// EX10: main.gopp:4:2: error: could not import errors (package errors is not in the module: no directory {{.*}}
// EX10: main.gopp:5:2: error: could not import fmt (package fmt is not in the module: no directory {{.*}}
// EX10: main.gopp:6:2: error: could not import mem (package mem is not in the module: no directory {{.*}}
// EX10: main.gopp:145:14: error: too many return values
// EX10: main.gopp:157:13: error: too many return values
// EX10: main.gopp:108:16: error: too many return values
// EX10: main.gopp:124:14: error: too many return values
